      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 0.85,
      "end_seconds": 2.62,
      "duration_seconds": 1.77,
      "text": "Evening. Let's get started."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 3.74,
      "end_seconds": 6.73,
      "duration_seconds": 2.99,
      "text": "Well, afternoon, is this seat fine?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 7.36,
      "end_seconds": 10.93,
      "duration_seconds": 3.57,
      "text": "thank you for fitting us in, doctor"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 12.76,
      "end_seconds": 15.6,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "How are things, what's been happening?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 16.45,
      "end_seconds": 20.05,
      "duration_seconds": 3.6,
      "text": "we came because of bloating after meals"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 21.45,
      "end_seconds": 23.42,
      "duration_seconds": 1.97,
      "text": "Did it come on recently?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 25.21,
      "end_seconds": 27.91,
      "duration_seconds": 2.7,
      "text": "right it's been two days now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 29.09,
      "end_seconds": 38.29,
      "duration_seconds": 9.2,
      "text": "can you describe it a bit more for me? How strong it is, what the pattern is, what helps"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 39.62,
      "end_seconds": 45.72,
      "duration_seconds": 6.1,
      "text": "it's worse with large meals. About a seven out of ten"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 47.57,
      "end_seconds": 50.71,
      "duration_seconds": 3.14,
      "text": "Has there been a lot of wind too?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 51.26,
      "end_seconds": 57.88,
      "duration_seconds": 6.62,
      "text": "erm yes about the same four weeks as for lot of wind mild really"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 58.75,
      "end_seconds": 64.12,
      "duration_seconds": 5.37,
      "text": "what about loose stools now and then, have you noticed that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 66.04,
      "end_seconds": 68.8,
      "duration_seconds": 2.76,
      "text": "Um yes for ten days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 70.81,
      "end_seconds": 75.59,
      "duration_seconds": 4.78,
      "text": "any night-time diarrhoea, blood in the stool, vomiting or weight loss?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 77.41,
      "end_seconds": 85.92,
      "duration_seconds": 8.51,
      "text": "erm, you know, no, no night-time diarrhoea, blood in the stool, vomiting or weight loss"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 87.69,
      "end_seconds": 89.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1,
      "text": "is your mobility otherwise okay?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 91.33,
      "end_seconds": 93.14,
      "duration_seconds": 1.81,
      "text": "I move fine otherwise"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 93.9,
      "end_seconds": 96.38,
      "duration_seconds": 2.48,
      "text": "any breathing difficulties apart from this?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 97.23,
      "end_seconds": 99.33,
      "duration_seconds": 2.1,
      "text": "no problems with breathing"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 100.69,
      "end_seconds": 104.69,
      "duration_seconds": 4.0,
      "text": "can you list what you take tablets creams or inhalers?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 105.91,
      "end_seconds": 114.64,
      "duration_seconds": 8.73,
      "text": "I take escitalopram, 10 milligrams, once a day i'm on pantoprazole, 40 milligrams, before breakfast for my acidity"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 115.52,
      "end_seconds": 124.2,
      "duration_seconds": 8.68,
      "text": "Doctor, I think the last prescription for the the pantoprazole was 20 milligrams. We changed it at the last visit."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 126.21,
      "end_seconds": 131.37,
      "duration_seconds": 5.16,
      "text": "okay have you got the newest prescription or the box with you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 132.85,
      "end_seconds": 143.78,
      "duration_seconds": 10.93,
      "text": "Not with me. I'll bring it next time. Sorry, what was I saying, I take Foracort inhaler, twice a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 145.45,
      "end_seconds": 153.31,
      "duration_seconds": 7.86,
      "text": "okay, so that's what's prescribed, but I'm not sure she takes it it every day"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 155.08,
      "end_seconds": 157.83,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "I'm on peppermint capsules after meals"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 163.0,
      "end_seconds": 167.96,
      "duration_seconds": 4.96,
      "text": "has anything ever caused you a reaction? I mean any allergies"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 169.71,
      "end_seconds": 171.59,
      "duration_seconds": 1.88,
      "text": "no allergies at all"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 180.89,
      "end_seconds": 184.17,
      "duration_seconds": 3.28,
      "text": "Okay now some background about your lifestyle."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 188.57,
      "end_seconds": 199.39,
      "duration_seconds": 10.82,
      "text": "I swim twice a week. I'm a hairdresser, on my feet all day. No, I share a house with my brother."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 201.3,
      "end_seconds": 205.13,
      "duration_seconds": 3.83,
      "text": "any health conditions I should have on record?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 205.86,
      "end_seconds": 212.9,
      "duration_seconds": 7.04,
      "text": "I have anxiety, for nearly five years. Acid reflux, for two years"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 213.84,
      "end_seconds": 214.63,
      "duration_seconds": 0.79,
      "text": "Mm-hmm."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 220.75,
      "end_seconds": 228.05,
      "duration_seconds": 7.3,
      "text": "yeah yes asthma i've been reading about it online and it worried me"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 229.1,
      "end_seconds": 230.39,
      "duration_seconds": 1.29,
      "text": "okay, what else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 231.74,
      "end_seconds": 241.4,
      "duration_seconds": 9.66,
      "text": "right so anxiety and asthma are already on your record we'll keep that in mind today did you ever have any procedures done?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 241.95,
      "end_seconds": 246.16,
      "duration_seconds": 4.21,
      "text": "just a a varicose vein procedure, last year"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 247.52,
      "end_seconds": 251.75,
      "duration_seconds": 4.23,
      "text": "right, shall I check your blood pressure and pulse?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 263.61,
      "end_seconds": 266.05,
      "duration_seconds": 2.44,
      "text": "okay, this won't take long.."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 275.31,
      "end_seconds": 284.72,
      "duration_seconds": 9.41,
      "text": "okay: temperature 36.5, blood pressure 125 over 74. And oxygen saturation is 98 percent, pulse is 75 beats a minute"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 287.28,
      "end_seconds": 291.99,
      "duration_seconds": 4.71,
      "text": "I'll need to examine you for this, it won't take long"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 305.94,
      "end_seconds": 307.04,
      "duration_seconds": 1.1,
      "text": "that's alright"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 308.07,
      "end_seconds": 309.32,
      "duration_seconds": 1.25,
      "text": "look straight ahead"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 325.09,
      "end_seconds": 332.0,
      "duration_seconds": 6.91,
      "text": "Your tummy is soft and not tender, and and I can't feel any lumps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 337.79,
      "end_seconds": 351.63,
      "duration_seconds": 13.84,
      "text": "please sit back down so, based on the history and the examination, I think we're dealing with a functional bowel pattern, with no alarm features at this stage we shouldn't forget irritable bowel syndrome"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 368.25,
      "end_seconds": 383.58,
      "duration_seconds": 15.33,
      "text": "Try smaller meals and keep a food and symptom diary for four weeks. And please bring the latest prescription or the medicine boxes to to the next visit so we can settle the dose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 384.16,
      "end_seconds": 394.48,
      "duration_seconds": 10.32,
      "text": "Okay, I'll look out for that. Let me think, should I have a coeliac blood test as well?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 395.32,
      "end_seconds": 401.89,
      "duration_seconds": 6.57,
      "text": "Not right now, it wouldn't change what we do today. Have I covered everything you wanted?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 402.82,
      "end_seconds": 406.25,
      "duration_seconds": 3.43,
      "text": "Good, thanks, I'll see you then."
    }
  ]
}